<p>Your Radiance is so powerful it burns all foes caught in it, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">20, 27, 32, 36, 40</acronym> light damage to all foes caught inside every turn.</p><p>Each enemy effected has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 12%, 17%, 20%, 22%</acronym> chance of being dazed and blinded by the light for 3 turns. The daze and blind can be applied to each enemy at most once every 7 turns.</p><p>The damage increases with your Spellpower.</p>